UID:14bf0be9cbe4bd6d9414f0b8f1ba@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Theater\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:­Elsewhere Shakespeare is a tiny organization that believes i
 n giving away the art that we make and the tools we use to make it. We are
  doing a huge Hamlet project called Guilty Creatures in October. One compo
 nent is a five-city tour from Troy NY to Salem MA in which a different act
 or will play Hamlet every night. The other component is a set of synchroni
 zed satellite shows happening in cities across the US on Tuesday October 2
 0th. All told\, there will be 12 different performances of Hamlet in 12 di
 fferent cities with 12 different actors playing Hamlet. And Atlanta is on 
 our list! Come out to Bold Monk\, grab a beer and watch some stellar Atlan
 ta-based actors perform a 90 minute cut of Hamlet\nCategory: Theater\nOrig
 inal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/elsewhere-shakespeare-presents
 -hamlet/
LOCATION:Bold Monk Brewing Co- The Abbey\, 1737 Ellsworth Industrial Blvd 
 Suite D-1\, Atlanta\, 30318
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/elsewhere-shakespeare-presents-hamlet/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:artsatl
END:VEVENT
