CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Theater\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:“The doors are open. The patients are waiting. Welcome to vi
 siting hours at Spring Street Asylum. Fluorescent lights buzzing\, linoleu
 m peeling\, and something rotten behind every closed door. Watch the insti
 tution unravel in real time: orderlies who know more than they’re lettin
 g on\, patients who insist they’re the sane ones\, and a staff smiling j
 ust a little too hard to be trusted. Every session\, every secret\, every 
 scream is built live\, in the room\, right in front of you. From the creat
 ors of Night of the Living Improv and The Improv Cult Show: Seek the Truth
  comes Whole World’s next immersive nightmare. Admission is voluntary. D
 ischarge is not guaranteed. This show is intended for a mature\nCategory: 
 Theater\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/spring-street-asy
 lum-an-immersive-halloween-improv-show/
