DESCRIPTION:Ages 6 and up: Join MODA and the Fulton County Library for LEG
 O Lab: Heroes & Villains. Families are invited to create heroes\, villains
 \, vehicles\, secret hideouts\, and action packed scenes using LEGO bricks
 . Kids ages 6 and up can invent original characters\, recreate epic showdo
 wns\, or work together on a shared world filled with adventure. This sessi
 on encourages imagination\, storytelling\, and hands-on design through pla
 y. Caregivers must remain with their children throughout the program. Duri
 ng LEGO Lab\, families will: Design heroes\, villains\, vehicles\, and act
 ion scenes with LEGO bricks Create stories through character and environme
 nt design Explore creative problem solving while building \nCategory: Art 
 + Design\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/lego-heros-and-v
 illains/
