 ies designed for artists ages 4-5 (Little Learners) and 6-12 (Studio KIDS!
 )\, we’ll take inspiration from works on view across the museum and the 
 Besthoff Sculpture Garden and make our own creations with a teaching artis
 t. About Studio KIDS!: Woven in Color After discussing color theory\, part
 icipants will walk through the galleries of the museum on a mission to spo
 t a series of color schemes and harmonies.  Artists will use their findin
 gs as inspiration\, creating their own woven artworks showcasing their cho
 sen color schemes using looms\, yarn\, and fabric. Thi\nCategory: Kids &am
 p\; Families\nOriginal listing: https://noma.org/event/studio-kids-woven-i
 n-color/
